{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/34719ac372d3f2f7a8851e38664656dd.poster.avif?t=1773324557\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/34719ac372d3f2f7a8851e38664656dd.webm?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/34719ac372d3f2f7a8851e38664656dd.mp4?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Experience</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Board Your Exclusive Mech and Rewrite the Rules of Battle</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every command you issue is directly transformed into battlefield action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/9413181c19250c300e32d2ba7aae7515.poster.avif?t=1773324557\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/9413181c19250c300e32d2ba7aae7515.webm?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/9413181c19250c300e32d2ba7aae7515.mp4?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Deployment</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The Art of War Within a 3x3 Grid</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control up to 9 combat units, activate circuit abilities through ingenious deployment, and create synergistic advantages where 1+1&gt;2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/d9380790ab04237621daa2b9b378eba9.poster.avif?t=1773324557\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/d9380790ab04237621daa2b9b378eba9.webm?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/d9380790ab04237621daa2b9b378eba9.mp4?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mech Enhancement</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Grow Stronger with Every Battle</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect chip cards to permanently enhance your mech's capabilities, combine them with item cards to adapt to real-time situations, and forge your unique combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/97b3c3d8372003e9e9b29106f4f1c908.poster.avif?t=1773324557\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/97b3c3d8372003e9e9b29106f4f1c908.webm?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/97b3c3d8372003e9e9b29106f4f1c908.mp4?t=1773324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Battle</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The Brutal Aesthetics of Strategic Execution</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform tactical plans into decisive victories on the battlefield and experience the direct feedback of decision-making and execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla